# FinTech AI Product Ideas — Domain Exploration & Build Roadmap
> Combining PerceptionX-style AI/ML Vision + Inference Pipeline with Deep Fintech Domain Knowledge

---

## Who This Document Is For

You have two rare things at once:
- **Technical depth**: YOLOv11 inference, GPU pipelines (Modal/Render), React + Node + Python, ByteTrack, MongoDB, Cloudinary CDN
- **Fintech domain depth**: MF Central, RTA bulk upload flows, MF onboarding (KYC, FATCA, nominee), banking sector workflows, stock market liquidity

Most AI builders have one or the other. You have both. This document is your ideation + prioritization framework to find the domain where these overlap into a product worth building.

