## Section 6 — Decision Matrix: Score Your Top Idea

Rate each idea 1–5 on these dimensions:

| Dimension | What to Score |
|-----------|--------------|
| **Domain Knowledge Advantage** | How much does YOUR MF/banking knowledge protect you from competitors? |
| **Technical Fit** | How directly does PerceptionX stack apply? |
| **Market Size** | How large is the addressable market in India? |
| **Revenue Clarity** | How obvious is the paying customer and pricing? |
| **Data Availability** | Can you get training data to build the AI model? |
| **Regulatory Complexity** | Will SEBI/RBI/IRDAI slow you down? |
| **Time to First ₹** | How quickly can you get a paying customer? |

### Pre-Scored Shortlist

| Idea | Domain Moat | Tech Fit | Market | Revenue | Data | Regulation | Speed | **Total** |
|------|-------------|----------|--------|---------|------|------------|-------|-----------|
| 1A — KYC Doc Intelligence | 5 | 4 | 5 | 5 | 3 | 3 | 3 | **28** |
| 1B — RTA Error Predictor | 5 | 3 | 3 | 5 | 4 | 2 | 5 | **27** |
| 1C — V-KYC Analyzer | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 4 | 3 | **28** |
| 2A — Bank Branch Queue | 3 | 5 | 5 | 5 | 4 | 2 | 4 | **28** |
| 2C — ATM Surveillance | 3 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 3 | 3 | **25** |
| 4A — Motor Claim Video | 2 | 5 | 5 | 5 | 4 | 3 | 4 | **28** |

### Recommendation: Top 2 to Pursue

**Primary: Idea 1C (V-KYC Analyzer)** — Uses your EXACT technical stack, uses your EXACT domain knowledge, SEBI mandate creates guaranteed demand, direct extension of PerceptionX.

**Secondary: Idea 1B (RTA Bulk Upload Error Predictor)** — Fastest to build (no GPU needed), immediate revenue, daily-use product, strong domain moat.

