## Section 7 — Build Roadmap for Top 2 Ideas

### Roadmap A: V-KYC Analyzer (12-week plan)

```
Week 1–2: Research & Data Collection
  □ Study SEBI circular on V-KYC requirements (SEBI/HO/MIRSD/MIRSD-PoD/P/2020/222)
  □ Collect 50+ V-KYC session recordings (consent-based, from MFDs you know)
  □ Define detection classes: face, PAN_card, Aadhaar_card, poor_lighting, blur

Week 3–4: Model Training
  □ Use LightningAI (like PerceptionX training) — train YOLOv11 on V-KYC frames
  □ Classes: {face_clear, face_occluded, document_visible, document_occluded, lighting_good, lighting_poor}
  □ Export best_vkyc.pt

Week 5–6: Core Pipeline (copy PerceptionX architecture)
  □ Replace best11.pt with best_vkyc.pt
  □ Replace traffic analytics with V-KYC compliance analytics
  □ Add: session recording, frame extraction at key moments, compliance scoring

Week 7–8: MF Integration Layer
  □ Build: KRA API integration (CAMS KRA, KFintech KRA) for PAN validation
  □ Build: CKYC fetch API integration
  □ Build: structured onboarding JSON export (ready for RTA submission)

Week 9–10: React Dashboard
  □ V-KYC session replay with overlay annotations
  □ Compliance checklist: ✅ Face liveness ✅ PAN captured ✅ Address confirmed
  □ MFD portal: all V-KYC sessions, pass/fail status, download compliance report

Week 11–12: Pilot
  □ 3 MFDs using your network — FREE pilot
  □ Iterate on compliance report format
  □ Price discovery: ₹100/session ceiling, find floor

Target: First paying customer by week 14
```

---

### Roadmap B: RTA Bulk Upload Error Predictor (4-week plan)

```
Week 1: Data & Format Research
  □ Collect BSE Star MF bulk upload format spec (available on BSE StAR MF portal)
  □ Collect NSE NMF II format spec
  □ Collect MFU bulk upload format spec
  □ Document ALL known error codes and their causes (from your experience)

Week 2: Core Engine
  □ Build Python validation engine: parse CSV, run 50+ rule checks
  □ Train lightweight classifier on error patterns (even 100 sample files is enough)
  □ Build auto-correct functions for top 10 most common errors

Week 3: React Frontend (already built in PerceptionX)
  □ Drag-drop CSV upload (copy from PerceptionX Home.jsx)
  □ Error table: row number, field, error type, suggested fix, one-click correct
  □ "Clean file ready" → download corrected CSV

Week 4: Pilot
  □ 10 MFD contacts from your network → free 30-day trial
  □ Track: errors caught, time saved, NPS
  □ Price: ₹999/month for up to 50 uploads/month

Target: First paying customer by week 5
```

