## Section 9 — Competitive Landscape

### V-KYC Space
| Competitor | Weakness | Your Advantage |
|-----------|---------|----------------|
| IDfy | Expensive (₹500+/session), no MF-specific features | ₹100/session + MF workflow integration |
| Signzy | Enterprise-only, complex integration | MFD-friendly, plug-and-play |
| DigiO (NPCI) | Focused on banking, not MF | Deep MF domain: KRA, RTA format, folio management |
| HyperVerge | International focus, expensive | India-first, MF Central integration |

### RTA Error Predictor Space
No direct competitor exists in India. This is a gap.

