## Section 10 — First Steps This Week

Regardless of which idea you pick, do these immediately:

```
Day 1:
  □ Write down the 10 MFDs / distributors in your network who would be your first users
  □ Call 3 of them — ask: "What's your biggest daily pain in client onboarding or transactions?"
  □ Note: Do they mention V-KYC pain? RTA upload errors? Both?

Day 2:
  □ Download BSE Star MF bulk upload format spec
  □ Download SEBI V-KYC guidelines (2020 circular)
  □ Read both — identify 5 specific pain points you can solve with code

Day 3:
  □ Fork your PerceptionX repo
  □ Create a new branch: fintech-pilot
  □ Replace the analytics page with a blank "Compliance Dashboard" template
  □ You now have a starting point

Day 4–5:
  □ Build the simplest possible version of Idea 1B (RTA error checker)
  □ Even a Python script that validates CSV rows is a demo
  □ Show it to 1 MFD → get their reaction
```

