| DPDP Act 2023 | Data protection for biometrics/video | Meity.gov.in |
| SEBI KYC Registration Agencies Regulations | KRA integration requirements | SEBI.gov.in |
| RBI Video KYC Guidelines | Bank V-KYC framework | RBI.org.in |
| AMFI Guidelines on V-KYC | MF-specific V-KYC | AMFI.com |
